      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "text": "reduccion = (tokens_base - tokens_gateway) / tokens_base x 100\n\nuna solicitud tipica    2,000  ->      842     -58%\n30 tareas del piloto   60,000  ->  <=36,000    meta -40%",
